    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We can\u2019t save the world alone - the OSA needs you, soldier. Enlist now by wishlisting Zero Caliber 2 Remastered!</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>THE SEQUEL</strong> ###</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite all-in-one VR FPS is back - and it\u2019s better in every way.<br><i>Zero Caliber 2 Remastered</i> is the full-blown sequel to the original, built on everything we learned during development and shaped by community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve been giving it everything we\u2019ve got to deliver the kind of VR shooter the <strong>PCVR community actually deserves</strong>\u00a0- no lazy ports, no shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/7d855dc8c9c643ee73098a9921afc893.avif?t=1755258751\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect intense, <strong>cinematic</strong> firefights, airstrikes, a <strong>massive</strong> arsenal to unlock, improved weapon handling, <strong>full campaign</strong> (<i>solo or co-op</i>), and head-to-head <i>PvP</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story picks up right where the first game left off - only <strong>louder, faster, and more explosive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Q3 2025 to Steam.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>COMMUNITY</strong> ###</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want behind-the-scenes stuff, sneak peeks, and some chaotic dev energy?<br>Hop into our Discord, we\u2019re in there when we aren't working on the release build - which is rare. Come join our community anyway!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/eeee1eda31df2f26c4cd8ba21ad65b75.avif?t=1755258751\" width=800 height=179 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We can\u2019t save the world alone - the OSA needs you, soldier. Enlist now by wishlisting Zero Caliber 2 Remastered!</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>THE SEQUEL</strong> ###</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite all-in-one VR FPS is back - and it\u2019s better in every way.<br><i>Zero Caliber 2 Remastered</i> is the full-blown sequel to the original, built on everything we learned during development and shaped by community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve been giving it everything we\u2019ve got to deliver the kind of VR shooter the <strong>PCVR community actually deserves</strong>\u00a0- no lazy ports, no shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/7d855dc8c9c643ee73098a9921afc893.avif?t=1755258751\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect intense, <strong>cinematic</strong> firefights, airstrikes, a <strong>massive</strong> arsenal to unlock, improved weapon handling, <strong>full campaign</strong> (<i>solo or co-op</i>), and head-to-head <i>PvP</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story picks up right where the first game left off - only <strong>louder, faster, and more explosive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Q3 2025 to Steam.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### <strong>COMMUNITY</strong> ###</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want behind-the-scenes stuff, sneak peeks, and some chaotic dev energy?<br>Hop into our Discord, we\u2019re in there when we aren't working on the release build - which is rare. Come join our community anyway!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719740/extras/eeee1eda31df2f26c4cd8ba21ad65b75.avif?t=1755258751\" width=800 height=179 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Zero Caliber 2 Remastered brings the full VR shooter experience to PC - with intense, cinematic firefights, a full single player and Co-op campaign, PvP, a huge arsenal to unlock, and character customization to make you stand out. Wishlist it if you\u2019re after a proper VR shooter. Dropping Q3.",
